# game/Locations/javalava.rpy:76
translate turkish suzybuy_75c50bfb:

    # "She's obviously still mad at me. I should try to talk to her at home sometime to see if we can patch things up."
    "Belli ki bana hâlâ kızgın. Bir ara evde onunla konuşup, aramızı düzeltebilir miyiz diye bakmalıyım."

# game/Locations/javalava.rpy:77
translate turkish suzybuy_2ad9f9e9:

    # "For now, I'll just leave."
    "Şimdilik, ben gideyim."

# game/Locations/javalava.rpy:82
translate turkish suzybuy_ca9233d4:

    # ss "Okay [bro], I'll make it, just one sec."
    ss "Tamam [bro], hazırlayacağım, bir saniye."

# game/Locations/javalava.rpy:84
translate turkish suzybuy_9c865c74:

